    "description": "A fun and interesting game where you can test your IQ, memory, and general knowledge, show off your intelligence and education, and prove how smart you are! It starts with simple questions and gets harder as the levels increase.\r\n\r\nAnswer challenging questions from all categories of interest. If you want to be a smart person, train your memory, logic, and self-learn. Challenge your friends and family in this trivia game! It's also great for players who want to get rich, as you can win virtual million-dollar bills.\r\n\r\nDo you know where Mount Olympus is? Or which birds can fly backward? In this trivia game, you'll find answers to many fun, curious, and rare questions.\r\n\r\nBy playing this free trivia game that relieves stress and relaxes, you can also unwind and forget about your daily worries.",
